# ── PERF-PROBE-KEEPWARM LANE (BH-9792) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Every minute: bin/perf-probe-keepwarm.sh reads state/perf-probe/<project>/
# keepwarm.json for each enabled row with keepwarm != false. Every
# PERF_PROBE_KEEPWARM_MIN minutes it GETs the first PERF_PROBE_KEEPWARM_ROUTES
# routes once with the open session. No result row, no ticket, 0 LLM calls.
# PERF_PROBE_KEEPWARM_FAIL_MAX failed rounds in a row pause the project until
# the next daily run or warm-up. The hub lease gates it. Off:
# flags/lane-off-perf-probe-keepwarm, or bin/harness-ctl.sh off perf-probe-keepwarm.
# Note: docs/notes/2026-11-17-BH-9786-perf-probe.md.
# @hub-lanes
* * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/perf-probe-keepwarm.sh >> /root/harness/logs/perf-probe-keepwarm.log 2>&1
